      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Programs-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><div>A Program is a feature that is typically used when a patient is identified as belonging to a group which needs regular consultations or interventions. For example, programs might be used for diseases such as HIV, tuberculosis or even conditions such as pregnancy or interventions such as childhood immunization.</div><h2 id=\"Programs-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The person at the Registration desk of the facility would predominantly use </span>this feature.</p><h2 id=\"Programs-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><div><p>Using Bahmni,  a program can be defined with a specific workflow and patients can be enrolled into this program. The patient's state changes over a timeline can be easily visualized. Separate reports can be generated for encounters within a program and for encounters that are not part of the program.</p><p>With the program module, it is possible to :</p><ol><li>Enroll a patient in a program</li><li>Track patient progress</li><li>Remove a patient from the program</li></ol></div><h2 class=\"p1\" id=\"Programs-Steps\">Steps</h2><h3 id=\"Programs-1.EnrollapatientinaProgram\">1. Enroll a patient in a Program</h3><p>To enroll a patient in a program, go to the program management page on the patient dashboard and select the program from the list, then select the state you want to assign to the patient and click enroll. A timeline will appear on the program page as well as the patient dashboard and the program will be visible as Active Program on the patient dashboard.<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.01.41%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767813&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.01.41%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767813&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27000858\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-08-17 at 4.01.41 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27000864\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"1d52de35-b66e-4bb2-8a7d-ab69baeb065e\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.01.41%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767813&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.01.41%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767813&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"Programs-2.TrackPatientProgress\">2. Track Patient Progress</h3><p>To change the state of the patient, select the program and click on &quot;Change State&quot;.<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.02.22%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767396&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.02.22%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767396&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27000859\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-08-17 at 4.02.22 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27000864\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"2d36e1fd-eddb-4e80-97e4-e45025501342\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.02.22%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767396&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.02.22%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767396&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><p>To see a snapshot of a patient's enrollment in various programs, see the &quot;Programs&quot; widget in the patient display control for a timeline of the programs the patient has been a part of.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.04.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814765593&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.04.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814765593&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27000862\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-08-17 at 4.04.20 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27000864\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"2cb5c567-cbb2-4469-9b75-10874c5d2e83\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.04.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814765593&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.04.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814765593&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"Programs-3.RemoveaPatientfromaProgram\">3. Remove a Patient from a Program</h3><p>To end the program for the patient, choose the program on the programs page and select an Outcome.<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.32%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767188&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.32%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767188&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27000860\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-08-17 at 4.03.32 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27000864\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"e7ec5ae8-09f8-47e9-b127-8f24054f028c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.32%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767188&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.32%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814767188&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400 1x\"></span><br/><br/></p><p>On ending the program, it will be shown as past program for the patient along with the outcome of the program.<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814766924&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814766924&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"27000861\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-08-17 at 4.03.40 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27000864\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"1150d9ec-657b-42e4-8c99-747fc667fe79\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814766924&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202015-08-17%20at%204.03.40%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1439814766924&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=400 1x\"></span></p><h3 id=\"Programs-4.VoidaPatientProgram\">4. Void a Patient Program</h3><p>A patient program can be voided from the UI. The user will have to enter a reason for voiding the program. The program will no longer be seen on the patient dashboard but a log entry will be <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">created about the voided program with audit information of who voided the program, reason to void the program and when the program was voided.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202016-10-14%20at%205.49.06%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476447626181&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=504&amp;height=394\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27000864/Screen%20Shot%202016-10-14%20at%205.49.06%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476447626181&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"92111195\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-10-14 at 5.49.06 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27000864\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"b61ac205-994a-43ae-a8ed-600dfb655860\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"h